title: Client View Page
description: >-
  View and manage client details in Taskip with profile overview, timeline,
  deals, projects, invoices, files, and activity history in one centralized
  client workspace.
sidebar:
  order: 2
---
The Client View Page in Taskip provides a centralized interface to view and manage all information related to a specific client. It combines contact details, business interactions, and activity tracking into a single workspace.

## Client Profile Section

### Description

Displays core client information and contact details.

### Example Data

- **Name:** Khairul Bashar
- **Email:** [khairulba@gmail.com](mailto:khairulba@gmail.com)
- **Phone:** 1620990841
- **Company / ID:** 1216
- **Tags:** N/A

### About This Contact

Includes:

- Contact information
- Tags
- Additional details
- Custom fields (if available)

### Details Section

Displays extended client information such as:

- Notes
- Business context
- Custom attributes

## Tabs and Modules

The Client View Page is divided into multiple tabs for structured access:

### Timeline

#### Description

Tracks all activities related to the client.

#### Includes:

- Client creation
- Updates
- Interactions
- System actions

### Deal

#### Description

Displays all deals associated with the client.

#### Use Cases:

- Track sales pipeline
- Monitor deal progress
- Manage opportunities

### Project

#### Description

Shows all projects linked to the client.

#### Capabilities:

- View project status
- Track progress
- Access deliverables

### Invoice

#### Description

Displays all invoices associated with the client.

#### Capabilities:

- View billing history
- Track payment status
- Access invoice details

### Quotation

#### Description

Lists all quotations created for the client.

#### Capabilities:

- Review proposals
- Track approval status
- Manage pricing discussions

### File

#### Description

Stores all files related to the client.

#### Examples:

- Documents
- Attachments
- Deliverables

### Note

#### Description

Internal notes for team collaboration.

#### Use Cases:

- Add reminders
- Store client-specific information
- Share internal updates

### Welcome Wizard

#### Description

Guided onboarding flow for new clients.

#### Purpose:

- Collect initial requirements
- Set up onboarding steps
- Improve client experience

### History

#### Description

Displays audit logs and system-generated activities.

#### Example Entry:

- **Date:** Apr 16, 2026
- **Time:** 09:17 AM
- **Action:** Created by Khairul Bashar Shamim

## System Behavior

- All client-related data is centralized in one view
- Tabs dynamically display linked data
- Timeline and History track all activities
- Updates reflect in real time across modules

## Use Cases

- Manage client relationships
- Track projects and deals
- Monitor invoices and payments
- Store and access client files
- Maintain communication history

## Best Practices

- Keep client details updated
- Use notes for internal communication
- Track all activities via timeline
- Link projects and deals properly
- Use tags for segmentation

## Summary

The Client View Page in Taskip provides a complete 360 degree view of a client by combining profile details, business interactions, and activity tracking. It enables efficient client management and ensures all relevant data is accessible in one place.
